graph TD 
    subgraph "Input Data" 
        A[User Input: Text/Reviews] --> B[Data Ingestion: CSV/API] 
    end 
 
    subgraph "Processing" 
        A & B --> C[Backend: Node.js/Python] 
        C --> D[IBM Watson NLP APIs] 
        D --> E[(Results Database)] 
    end 
 
    subgraph "Output" 
        E --> F[Dashboard: Angular/React] 
        F --> G[End Users: Feedback/Analysis] 
    end 
